Attribution for adapted material

The statistical workflow in scripts/differential.R is adapted from the msqrob2
documentation and the Statistical Genomics / Proteomics Data Analysis course
material by Lieven Clement and colleagues (statOmics, Ghent University), which
is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0). The adaptations are described in comments
in that script. Anyone redistributing the adapted statistical workflow should
honour the ShareAlike term of the original.

The MaxQuant peptide table used by scripts/09_compare_maxquant.sh is retrieved
from the statOmics/msqrob2data repository and is not redistributed here.
